et_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "morphism of locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "环化空间的态射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "局部环化空间（Locally ringed spaces）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>局部环化空间（locally ringed space）<MATH_0001><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个二元组（pair），由拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0002>和环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0003>组成，且后者的所有茎（stalks）都是局部环（local rings）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 给定局部环化空间（locally ringed space）<MATH_0004>，我们称<MATH_0005>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0006>在（at）<MATH_0007>处的局部环（local ring）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n我们用<MATH_0008>（或简写为<MATH_0009>）表示<MATH_0010>的极大理想（ideal）。\n此外，<TEXTITOPEN_0003><MATH_0011>在（at）<MATH_0012>处的剩余域（residue field）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>是剩余域（residue field）<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0004> <TEXTITOPEN_0004>局部环化空间的态射（morphism of locally ringed spaces）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004><MATH_0014>是满足下述条件的环化空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）。对所有<MATH_0015>，诱导的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0016>都是局部环（local ring）映射（map）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:1c178735b90551705077d65149a31c9cf70618d6d015cb4ba54c6b0c1d0f245d", "unit_id": "tag:01HB:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "定义标题所指的对象类型", "source_term": "Locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"context": "此处由拓扑空间和满足条件的环层定义的对象", "source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"context": "由拓扑空间和环层组成的数据", "source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"context": "二元组的第一个组成部分", "source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"context": "二元组的第二个组成部分", "source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"context": "对这些对象逐一施加局部环条件", "source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"context": "定义中对环层各茎的要求", "source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"context": "接下来记述局部环的给定空间", "source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"context": "术语库存所列的局部环取点用语", "source_term": "at", "target_term": "在"}, {"context": "给定空间在指定点处的环", "source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"context": "给定局部环的极大理想", "source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"context": "术语库存所列的剩余域取点用语", "source_term": "at", "target_term": "在"}, {"context": "给定空间在指定点处的域", "source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"context": "用于标识该域的局部环剩余域", "source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"context": "此处通过茎上条件定义的态射", "source_term": "morphism of locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间的态射"}, {"context": "满足额外条件的底层态射", "source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "环化空间的态射"}, {"context": "在茎上诱导的映射", "source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"context": "术语库存所列的局部环映射的组成词", "source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"context": "术语库存所列的局部环映射的组成词", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}]}
